B.VB=new A.fk('Tilly was a turkey who lived on a farm with a big red barn. Every morning she fluffed her feathers and said, "I wish I had something exciting to be happy about."',"story_farm","char_tilly_turkey")
B.Vy=new A.fk('One day a little girl named Maya walked by. "Good morning, Tilly!" she said. She sprinkled corn on the ground. Tilly gobbled it up. "Yum," said Tilly. "That was a nice surprise."',"story_farm","char_kid_cook")
B.VE=new A.fk("Next, the sun came out and warmed her feathers. A friend, a brown hen, shared her straw. Tilly noticed three nice things before lunch.","story_cornfield","char_tilly_turkey")
B.VD=new A.fk('That night Tilly picked a golden leaf. She said, "I am thankful for corn, for sunshine and for my friends." And she felt warm all the way to her tail feathers.',"story_farm","char_tilly_turkey")
B.Nk=s([B.VB,B.Vy,B.VE,B.VD],t.WD)
B.VK=new A.w4("tilly-turkey","Tilly the Thankful Turkey","story_farm",B.Nk,"What is one small thing that made you smile today?")
B.VG=new A.fk('It was Thanksgiving morning. Grandma tied on her apron. "Today we need lots of helpers," she said. Sam put on a chef apron and picked up a big bowl.',"story_kitchen","char_grandma")
B.VC=new A.fk('First, Sam measured. Two cups of cranberries, one cup of sugar. "Level cups, please," said Grandma. Sam leveled each scoop with a spoon.',"story_kitchen","char_kid_cook")
B.VH=new A.fk('Then Sam counted the guests. "Eight people. That means eight plates, eight forks and eight cups." Grandma smiled. "You are a great planner."',"story_family_table","char_kid_cook")
B.VA=new A.fk('At last everyone sat down. The candles glowed. Grandma said, "Before we eat, let us each say one thing we are thankful for." Sam said, "I am thankful for all of you."',"story_family_table","char_grandma")
